{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの中で、握手会で話す話題について宿題を出してたのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが遅い時間に日記書いて、反映に時間がかかってしまいました('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさいっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、次は巻いた髪をサイドに結んだ画像が見たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/24/201112231555000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初まきまきサイドひめたん＼(∀)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は中学生８人組のみんなで楽しく握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"８人で一番お姉さんだったひめ姉頑張りましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずいぶん握手会の流れがはやくて早口でおしゃべりしちゃったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんサンタさんのパワー、ちゃーんとみなさんに届きましたかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログの感想、アドバイス、お褒めの言葉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに愛の告白まで(*^^*)ぽ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族とまったり過ごすクリスマスしか知らないひめたんには新鮮な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イブっイブー♪でした^^←ココ重要わら"},{"type":"break"},