ak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！ひめたんって男性にどんな格好してほしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"してほしい髪型とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的には似合ってればおっけーかな(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着ぐるみが似合う人は、ずっと着ぐるみ着てって思うくらい←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん的にぴんく似合う人はぽいんと高い∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんもよかったらチャレンジしてみて下さーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/note.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島カープは来シーズンはどうですかねぇ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんあんま野球詳しくないけどー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも広島カープこれからも応援しますよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤ヘルぢゃん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ZONE『secret base～君がくれたもの～』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲今から10年前の2001年にヒットした曲でひめたん、当時5歳だよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってたんだ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって名曲ですから(*^^*)さいこーおの～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出を～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは広島のスクールには何年くらい通っていたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小４の秋から中３の秋までだから、丸５年間かな(ω)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクールでは歌とダンスはもちろん、礼儀までしっかり教えていただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの時も今も、これからもずっと感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクール大好きです!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}